# Capri's memory is personal and local-only. The repository this lives in is
# public and has a post-commit hook that auto-pushes, so nothing in here may
# ever be tracked: facts.md holds personal facts, capri.db holds every
# conversation ever had with her.
data/
logs/

# transient
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
.venv/
__pycache__/
